.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Quarto temporary directories (source-tree render artifacts).
# Keep the rendered figure folders that live under the published docs/ site,
# otherwise the GitHub Pages site would have broken images now that chapters
# are no longer self-contained.
*_files/
!/docs/**/*_files/

# Duplicate-file artifacts ("filename 2.ext", "dir 3", "name 4.map") created
# during bulk writes (e.g. a full `quarto render`) or cloud-sync conflicts.
# Source unconfirmed, but never commit them. Covers any " <n>" / " <nn>" suffix,
# with or without an extension.
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9]
* [0-9][0-9].*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor backup files
*.bak

# Local-only Claude Code guidance
CLAUDE.md

# Local-only manuscript notes & draft snippets (suggestions for the main
# manuscript). Kept on disk for the author but never synced to GitHub.
manuscript_notes/

# ---- Internal working notes: never publish ----
# Manuscript-review artefacts, reviewer comment logs, submission checklists.
# These name individual coauthors and reviewers.
unresolved_comments_*.md
comment_revision_guide.md
manuscript_review_checklist.md
A1_*.md
A2_*.md
BiO_*.md
final_check_*.md
figure_format_fix.md
supplement_build_notes.md
repo_release_checklist.md
discussion_revised.tex

# ---- Build noise ----
render.log
overleaf_upload/
main_trimmed.tex
# ---- Secrets: never commit ----
# The Zenodo helper reads its token from $ZENODO_TOKEN, but guard against a
# stray env file or token dump landing in the repo.
.env
*.token
zenodo_token*
